<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n190" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁβρότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>splendour, luxury,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμους ἁβρότατος</span> houses <i>of
				luxury,</i> i. e. <i>luxurious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				11.34
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ Μήδων στολῇ καὶ ἁβρότητι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.8.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.122c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				968
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐν ἁβρότητι κεῖσαι</span>
			thou art not in a position <i>to be fastidious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				1343
			</span></i>; also, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁβρότατος ἔπι</span> in
				<i>the freshness of youth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				8.89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of style,
				<i>sweetness, charm,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
